# R39 Phase 2e Round-close R1 (2026-08-09) — `??` with `SReturn(None)`
# bare divergent RHS.  Bare `return` (no value) in a void function
# diverges — the enclosing `EDo` types as Never.  Same class as
# `dop_return_rhs.gg`; separate cell because pre-fold the `SReturn`
# arm distinguished None vs Some via `if opt_expr is Some(...)` and
# both fell to `void_id`.
#
# RED signature pre-fold (against HEAD 0fb64cf0c): the pre-fold
# `SReturn(None) → types.void_id` returned `void`, which is neither
# the inner `int` nor the same `Option[int]` carrier, so
# `check_default_op_rhs` at typecheck.gg:699-707 rejected with
# `E_DefaultOpRhsTypeMismatch`.
#
# Post-fold: `SReturn(_) → never_id` accepts.

void process(Option[int] o):
    int v = o ?? return
    print(f"got {v}")

void main():
    process(Some(42))
    process(None)
    print("done")
